{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04783","headline":"岳州作 · 张说","name":"岳州作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国生秋草，离居再及瓜。\n山川临洞穴，风日望长沙。\n物土南州异，关河北信赊。\n日昏闻怪鸟，地热见修虵。\n远人梦归路，瘦马嘶去家。\n正有江潭月，徘徊恋九华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}